{"headword":"דָּגָן","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m. corn, grain</strong> (of cereals) <strong>(</strong>NH <em>id.</em>, Sam. <span dir=\"rtl\">ࠃࠂࠍ</span> v. Thes.; cf. Ph. <span dir=\"rtl\">ארצת דגן</span><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">דָּגָן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:28\" href=\"/Genesis.27.28\">Gn 27:28</a> + 29 times; cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּגַן</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:24\" href=\"/Psalms.78.24\">ψ 78:24</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּגָנִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:11\" href=\"/Hosea.2.11\">Ho 2:11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּגָֽנְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 7:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.7.13\">Dt 7:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:17\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.17\">12:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 14:23\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.14.23\">14:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 18:4\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.18.4\">18:4</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּגָנֶ֑ךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 11:14\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.11.14\">Dt 11:14</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּגָנֵךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 62:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.62.8\">Is 62:8</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּגָנָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 4:8\" href=\"/Psalms.4.8\">ψ 4:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 65:10\" href=\"/Psalms.65.10\">65:10</a>—<em>corn</em>, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">תִּירוֹשׁ</span> <em>must</em>, q.v., <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:28\" href=\"/Genesis.27.28\">Gn 27:28</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:37\" href=\"/Genesis.27.37\">37</a> (both J) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 4:8\" href=\"/Psalms.4.8\">ψ 4:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 62:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.62.8\">Is 62:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:11\" href=\"/Hosea.2.11\">Ho 2:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:14\" href=\"/Hosea.7.14\">7:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 9:1\" href=\"/Hosea.9.1\">9:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 9:17\" href=\"/Zechariah.9.17\">Zc 9:17</a>; cf. also <a data-ref=\"Numbers 18:27\" href=\"/Numbers.18.27\">Nu 18:27</a> (P; here, for <span dir=\"rtl\">תירושׁ</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">מְלֵא